4
00:02:33,770 --> 00:02:35,170
Come on, you can tell me.

5
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,380
Queen of Thorns give you one last prick in the balls

6
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:39,930
before saying goodbye?

7
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:42,400
