82
00:06:08,010 --> 00:06:10,160
As soon as the gold arrives.

83
00:06:14,130 --> 00:06:15,210
This is for you.

84
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:23,120
The last man who wielded it meant to cut your throat,

85
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,750
but your mother fought him off.

86
00:06:33,450 --> 00:06:34,710
The other dagger,

87
00:06:35,710 --> 00:06:37,220
the one that took her life,

88
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:41,400
I would have stopped that dagger with my own heart

89
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,680
if I could have.

90
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:47,600
I wasn't there for her when she needed me most.

91
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,370
But I am here for her now

92
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:54,030
to do what she would have done,

93
00:06:54,990 --> 00:06:56,800
to protect her children.

94
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:03,140
Anything I can do for you, Brandon,

95
00:07:04,140 --> 00:07:05,680
