96
00:07:08,340 --> 00:07:10,260
Do you know who this belonged to?

97
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:11,900
No.

98
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:18,000
That very question was what started the War of the Five Kings.

99
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:21,510
In a way, that dagger made you what you are today.

100
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,710
Forced from your home,

101
00:07:24,010 --> 00:07:26,290
driven out to the wilds beyond the Wall.

102
00:07:27,110 --> 00:07:31,000
I imagine you've seen things most men wouldn't believe.

103
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:43,780
To go through all of that and make your way home again

104
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:47,850
only to find such chaos in the world,

105
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,470
I can only imagine--

106
00:07:49,470 --> 00:07:51,310
Chaos is a ladder.

107
00:08:03,990 --> 00:08:06,060
I'm sorry to have disturbed you, Lord Stark.

108
00:08:06,660 --> 00:08:08,130
I'm not Lord Stark.

109
00:08:19,530 --> 00:08:20,370
What's that?

110
00:08:21,660 --> 00:08:23,370
Maester Wolkan built it for me

111
00:08:23,370 --> 00:08:24,960
