118
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:44,400
Well, as safe as anyone can be now.

119
00:08:45,350 --> 00:08:46,800
You don't need me anymore.

120
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,220
No, I don't.

121
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,140
That's all you've got to say?

122
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,370
Thank you.

123
00:09:00,190 --> 00:09:01,210
Thank you?

124
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,490
For helping me.

125
00:09:05,830 --> 00:09:07,460
My brother died for you.

126
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,660
Hodor and Summer died for you.

127
00:09:11,230 --> 00:09:12,780
I almost died for you.

128
00:09:16,870 --> 00:09:19,680
- Bran... - I'm not, really.

129
00:09:21,770 --> 00:09:22,990
Not anymore.

130
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:28,830
I remember what it felt like to be Brandon Stark,

131
00:09:29,980 --> 00:09:31,970
but I remember so much else now.

132
00:09:39,490 --> 00:09:41,170
You died in that cave.

133
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:20,550
I did.

134
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:23,510
The kitchen girl, the redhead with the behind.

135
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:26,920
The only thing in the kitchen that you've put your cock in is the liver.

136
00:10:28,290 --> 00:10:30,490
'Ey up. Where you going?

137
00:10:31,350 --> 00:10:34,090
In there. I live here.

138
00:10:34,310 --> 00:10:35,450
Fuck off.

139
00:10:35,620 --> 00:10:37,720
I'm Arya Stark. This is my home.

140
00:10:41,830 --> 00:10:43,350
Arya Stark's dead.

141
00:10:45,850 --> 00:10:47,950
Send for Maester Luwin or Ser Rodrik.

142
00:10:47,950 --> 00:10:50,790
- They'll tell you who I am. - There's no Rodrik here.

143
00:10:51,070 --> 00:10:52,770
Maester's named Wolkan.

144
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:56,110
Go ask Jon Snow, then, the King in the North.

145
00:10:56,130 --> 00:10:58,600
- He's my brother. - He's a thousand miles away.

146
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:01,410
Look, it's cold and we're busy,

147
00:11:01,410 --> 00:11:04,320
so, you know, best fuck off.

148
00:11:05,810 --> 00:11:08,000
