149
00:11:08,830 --> 00:11:12,670
The Lady of Winterfell. Lady Stark.

150
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,470
- Which Lady Stark? - You tell us.

151
00:11:14,470 --> 00:11:16,700
You're the one impersonating her sister.

152
