157
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:44,510
But if I am and Sansa finds out you turned me away...

158
00:11:51,950 --> 00:11:54,150
Right, you sit there.

159
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:55,450
Right there.

160
00:11:57,110 --> 00:11:57,980
Don't move.

161
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,890
Right, go tell Lady Stark. I'll watch her.

162
00:12:01,890 --> 00:12:04,290
I ain't telling Lady Stark. You can tell her.

163
00:12:05,250 --> 00:12:06,070
Why me?

164
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,530
- You're gonna tell her. - I'm not.

165
00:12:33,530 --> 00:12:36,490
'Cause if you don't, I'm gonna hit you right in the fucking face

166
00:12:36,490 --> 00:12:37,900
as hard as I can.

167
00:12:46,810 --> 00:12:48,110
