214
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,940
I thought you might go to King's Landing.

215
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:57,860
So did I.

216
00:16:58,530 --> 00:17:00,070
Why would you go back there?

217
00:17:00,750 --> 00:17:02,720
Cersei's on her list of names.

218
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:15,970
Who else is on your list?

219
00:17:16,510 --> 00:17:18,140
Most of them are dead already.

220
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:30,330
Where did you get this?

221
00:17:31,450 --> 00:17:33,180
Littlefinger gave it to me.

222
00:17:34,190 --> 00:17:36,380
Littlefinger? He's here?

223
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:38,200
He has declared for House Stark.

224
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:40,050
